# Generated content inside each test crate
**/generated/

# type_shapes/ commits its generated SDK so reviewers can diff codegen
# behavior directly. Only `baml_sdk/` is committed; everything else
# under `generated/` (pyproject.toml, test.sh, test.ps1, test_main.py
# symlink, .venv, .uv-cache, etc.) is regenerated by build.rs on every
# build.
!type_shapes/generated/baml_sdk/**

# Re-ignore Python runtime artifacts uv/pytest scatter through the SDK tree.
type_shapes/generated/baml_sdk/**/__pycache__/
type_shapes/generated/**/*.pyc
